senses.gloss:
निष्-√ पद् Ā. -पद्यते, to fall out (Subj. -पद्यातै), ŚBr.;
to come forth, issue, arise, be brought about or effected, become ripe, ripen, Mn.; MBh. &c.:
Caus. -पादयति, ˚ते, to bring about, accomplish, perform, do, make (with राज्यम्, ‘to reign’), cause to ripen, MBh.; R.; Var. &c.

नि-√ शम् P. -शाम्यति, to be extinguished, Dharmaś.; Divyāv. :
Caus. -शमयति, to appease, make quiet, AV. vi, 52, 3; 111, 2;
to cool down, Sāy. on RV. x, 39, 9;
 -शामयति or -शमयति (ep. also -शाम्यते; p. -शम्यमान with act. meaning, R. [B.] ii, 66, 10; ind.p. -शाम्य or -शम्य and -शमय्य [Śiś. xvi, 38; cf. Vām. v, 2, 76]),
to observe, perceive, hear, learn, MBh.; Kāv. &c.

2. नि-√ शि (for 1. See p. 560) P. -शिशाति (Ā. p. -शिशान), to sharpen, whet;
to excite, strengthen;
 prepare or present (food &c.) for strengthening, RV. (cf. नि-शो).

नि-√ शास् P. -शास्ति (aor. -अशिषत्), to order off, order to go off, separate from (instr.), AV.;
to take anything (acc.) from (abl.), TS.;
to adjudge or present to (dat.), RV. iv, 2, 7.

नि-√ श्वस् P. -श्वसिति, ep. also ˚सति (pf. -शश्वास aor. or impf. न्य्-अश्वसत्, MBh.; ˚श्वसीत्, Daś.; ind.p. -श्वस्य),
to draw in the breath, inspire;
to hiss, snort &c., MBh.; Kāv. &c. (often v.l. निह्-श्व्˚).

नि-षद् (√ सद्) P. -षीदति, Ved. also -षदति (impf. न्य्-अषीदत्, or न्य्-असीदत्; Ved. also -असदत्; pf. P. -षसाद, -षेदुर् Ā. -षेदिरे, RV. &c. &c.; aor. P. -षत्सि, -षत्सत्; Pass. न्य्-असादि, RV.; ind.p. -षद्य, ib.; Ved. inf. -ष॑दे, ib.; for स् and ष् cf. Pāṇ. viii, 3, 66 &c.),
to sit or lie down or rest upon (loc.), RV. &c. &c.;
to sink or go down (as a ship), Hariv.;
to be afflicted, suffer pain, MW.;
to perform or celebrate by sitting (सत्त्रम्), Br.;
 (P. Ā.) to set, found, establish, appoint, RV. :
Caus. -षादयति, ˚ते to cause to sit down, set down, appoint, RV.

नि-षिध् (√ 2. सिध्) P. -षेधति (impf. न्य्-अषेधत्; aor. न्य्-अषेधीत्; pf. निषिषेध; Pass. नि-षिध्यते impf. न्य्-अषिध्यत aor. न्य्-अषेधि; ind.p. नि-षिध्य inf. नि-षेद्धुम्; cf. Pāṇ. viii, 3, 65, Sch.),
to drive away, RV.; AV.;
to ward off, keep back, prevent from (abl.), AitBr.; MBh.; Kāv. &c.;
to forbid, prohibit, object to (acc.), Kathās.; BhP.;
to keep down, suppress, outdo, surpass, Kāvyād. ii, 64 :
Caus. -षेधयति, to keep off, prohibit, forbid, Pañc.; BhP.;
to deny, W.

नि-षेव् (√ सेव्) Ā. -षेवते (impf. न्य्-अषेवत pf. नि-षिषेवे, Pāṇ. viii, 3, 70 &c.; ind.p. -षेव्य),
to stay in, abide or have intercourse with (loc.), RV.; AV.;
 (with acc.) to frequent, inhabit, visit, serve, attend, honour, worship, follow, approach, enjoy (also sexually), incur, pursue, practise, perform, cultivate, use, employ, Mn.; MBh. &c.:
Caus. -षेवयति to fall into (hell &c.), Pañc. (B.), iii, 155 ;
 Desid. -षिषेविषते, Pāṇ. viii, 3, 70, Kāś.

निष्-√ कुष् P. -कुषति (fut. कोषिता, or -कोष्टा; inf. -कोषितुम् or -कोष्टुम् &c., Pāṇ. vii, 2, 46; 47),
to pull out, extract;
to injure or hurt by tearing, BhP.;
to shell, husk (see below).

निष्-√ 1. कृ P. Ā. -करोति, -कुरुते &c. (2. pl. -कृथ impf. -अस्कृत [Padap. & Prāt. -अकृत], -क्रन्त, RV.; Impv. -कुरु, AV. -कृधि, ib.; -कृणोतन, RV. pres. p. -कृण्वान, ib.; aor. Pass. निर्-अकारि, Bhaṭṭ.),
to bring out, extract, drive away, expel, remove, RV.; AV.; ŚBr.;
to break in pieces, Bhaṭṭ.;
to arrange, set in order, prepare, RV.; TS. (cf. इष्-कृ);
to restore, cure, RV.; AV.

निष्-√ क्रम् P. Ā. -क्रामति, -क्रमते (-क्रमति, R. ind.p. -क्रम्य; inf. -क्रामितुम्, -क्रमितुम्, or -क्रान्तुं),
to go out, come forth, go or come from (abl., rarely gen.), depart, RV. &c. &c.;
to leave (worldly life), Divyāv.;
 (in dram.) to make an exit:
Caus. -क्रामयति (Pass. -क्राम्यते), to cause to go out, drive or let out, deliver, ŚBr.; Kāv. &c.

निष्-टप् (√ तप्) to singe, scorch, MBh.;
to heat thoroughly, melt (as gold, according to Pāṇ. viii, 3, 102 निस्-तप्, if the action is repeated) anneal, purify by heat, free from impurities, TBr.; MBh.; R. &c.;
to roast, fry, R.; Hariv.

नि-ष्ठा (√ स्था; aor. न्य्-अष्ठात् pf. नि-तस्थौ, Vop.) :
Caus. (aor. न्य्-अतिष्ठिपत्) to fix in (loc.), ŚBr.;
to give forth, emit, yield, HPariś.

निष्-√ पीड् P. -पीडयति (ind.p. -पीड्य; Pass. -पीड्यते),
to press or squeeze out, press together or against, ĀśvGṛ.; MBh.; Suśr. &c.;
to contract (in pronouncing), Śikṣ.

निष्-√ पृ P. -पिपर्ति (2. pl. -पिपृथः, Impv. -पिपर्तन Subj. aor. -पर्षत्), to bring out, rescue or deliver from (abl.), RV.;
to come out (Impv. नि॑ष्-पर v.l. निथ्वर), TS. :
Caus. -पारयति, to help out, rescue, RV.

नि-√ स्यन्द् Ā. -स्यन्दते (or -ष्य्˚; cf. Pāṇ. viii, 3, 72),
to flow or trickle down, flow into (loc.), BhP.;
to make any fluid drop or drip or trickle down (only -स्यन्दते, Pāṇ.; ib.; Vop.)

निस्-√ तॄ P. -तरति (ind.p. -तीर्य inf. -तर्तुम्), to come forth from, get out of, escape from (abl.), MBh.;
to pass over or through, cross (sea &c.), pass or spend (time);
to overcome or master (an enemy), MBh.; Kāv. &c.;
to fulfil, accomplish, perform (promise, vow &c.), ib.;
to suffer for, expiate (acc.), R.; BhP.;
 (with अभियोगम्) to clear one's self from an accusation, Yājñ. :
Caus. -तारयति, to rescue, save, deliver from (abl.), Mn. iii, 98;
to overcome, overpower, Cat.;
 Desid. -तितीर्षति &c., to wish to cross or pass over (acc.), BhP.
